## TIẾNG ANH · 16:30–17:00 — Thứ Hai: Daily standup

> *"Morning. Last week of the backend month — testing, CI, and rate limiting.*
> *Today was testing, and the ratio is the opposite of what I do on mobile. On mobile I lean on component tests. On the backend most of my tests are integration tests hitting a real Postgres, because almost every backend bug I've had is at the boundary where my code meets the database. A mocked database doesn't have real constraints, so it can't catch the bugs that matter.*
> *The most valuable test I wrote today: user A tries to delete user B's record and gets a 404, and the record is still there afterwards. I found that class of bug by hand last week. Today I made it impossible for it to come back.*
> *I'm using Neon's branching so tests run against a separate database branch rather than a mock. Whole suite is [N] seconds — I care about that number, because if it gets past a minute I'll stop running it.*
> *Tomorrow: wiring this into CI."*

**5 từ mới:**

| Từ / cụm | Nghĩa | Câu mẫu |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `lean on` | dựa vào chủ yếu | *On mobile I lean on component tests.* |
| `boundary where X meets Y` | chỗ giáp ranh | *The boundary where my code meets the database.* |
| `that class of bug` | loại bug đó | *I found that class of bug by hand.* |
| `come back` (về bug) | tái xuất hiện | *I made it impossible for it to come back.* |
| `whole suite` | toàn bộ bộ test | *The whole suite is thirty seconds.* |

